      <h1 data-split>The same engine, shared by the whole team</h1>
      <p class="lede">A self-hosted web app for building pipelines together, running them against shared sources, reviewing what STORM found, and keeping an audit trail you can hand to a reviewer. Deployed with one Docker Compose file on a host you control.</p>
